Issuance of license and acknowledgment of conditions;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"p-762.2(b)(29)\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"indent-2\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"paragraph-hierarchy\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"paren\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e29\u003cspan class=\"paren\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e § 750.8, Revocation or suspension of license;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"p-762.2(b)(30)\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"indent-2\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"paragraph-hierarchy\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"paren\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e30\u003cspan class=\"paren\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e § 750.9, Duplicate licenses;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"p-762.2(b)(31)\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"indent-2\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"paragraph-hierarchy\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"paren\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e31\u003cspan class=\"paren\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e § 750.10, Transfer of licenses for export;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"p-762.2(b)(32)\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"indent-2\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"paragraph-hierarchy\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"paren\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e32\u003cspan class=\"paren\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e-\u003cspan class=\"paren\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e39\u003cspan class=\"paren\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e [Reserved]\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"p-762.2(b)(40)\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"indent-2\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"paragraph-hierarchy\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"paren\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e40\u003cspan class=\"paren\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e § 754.4, Unprocessed western red cedar;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"p-762.2(b)(41)\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"indent-2\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"paragraph-hierarchy\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"paren\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e41\u003cspan class=\"paren\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e § 758.1 and § 758.2, Automated Export System record;\u